// The deserts' own animals (V2-10 (b)), Palearctic and Nearctic: the camels, the addax and
// gazelles, the wild ass, the fennec and the sand cat, jerboas and kangaroo rats that never
// drink, the jackrabbit and the roadrunner, rattlesnakes, the horned viper, the Gila monster and
// the desert tortoise. Values rounded from general mammal, ornithological and herpetological
// references and arid-land field studies; densities for good habitat (a desert's are low).
