            ],
            temperament: (flight_m: 500, boldness: 0.2),
            notes: "Two humps of fat, a winter coat it sheds in ragged sheets, and kidneys that let it drink brackish water; it closes its nostrils against the sand. Shyer than any domestic camel.",
